<ul>
<li>Fixed dictation that was sometimes inserted twice in some apps, such as chat apps. If Amanu cannot confirm that the text arrived, it no longer inserts it a second time. The HUD says it could not confirm the text and offers Copy. Your clipboard is kept; the text goes on it only when the clipboard was empty. Amanu then uses paste for that app until the app is updated.</li>
<li>Apps built on Electron or Chromium, such as many desktop chat apps and Chromium browsers, now receive dictation by paste from the first try.</li>
<li>Amanu no longer runs two copies at the same time. If you open a second copy, it quits and the running Amanu opens its Settings window.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
